Image prompt rules: describe only what IS visible; never use negations (no, without, not, lacking, absent) because the image model ignores them and draws the thing anyway; describe the replacement instead (e.g. "a smooth blank head with a single thin dark slit" rather than "no face"). Whatever the subject (person, creature, place, object, event or god), name at least two details unique to this world so the image never falls back to a generic real-world look.
